      <title>MonoMac</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Mono Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk will cover the basics of MonoMac and how the Mono runtime was integrated with the Objective-C runtime.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Although MonoMac is actively being developed on OSX, there are efforts to make it run also out of the box with two open source Objective-C/AppKit Stacks.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
